<title>PERU: Peru's Q1 trade deficit falls 26.5 percent.</title>
<headline>Peru's Q1 trade deficit falls 26.5 percent.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peru's trade deficit fell 26.5 percent in the first quarter of the year to $268 million from $364 million in the same period last year, the Central Reserve Bank said Friday.</p>
</text>
